Writer
======
it is not an editor
and this readme is written with it, enjoy.

USAGE
=====
to save and exit press ctrl+D twice or once on newline
to start writing another paragraph press enter twice

If working on a screen that is to small for the standard
almost in center text add -n after the input file to make
the cursor start at 0 0
If working on a diary or creative text where
you would want to append text to already existing
file add -a after the file to enter append mode
